# The siege arm with a memory: arty + scout, so the counter remembers air.
#
# screen-vh9's losing seeds die to air the mix could answer but forgets
# (log 2026-07-31): hoverTank hits air, but without scout the counter tilts
# only while a raider is on screen -- the intel-memory path that would hold
# the tilt between raids is scout-gated. Scouting also feeds the raid-less
# intel the interception ladder reads. The cost is a scout's 200 credits and
# a worker slot per sighting sweep.

name aa-counter-guard-arty-scout
goals extractorT1,extractorT1,extractorT1,c_tank,c_tank,c_tank,hoverTank,c_artillery
heavies none
max_workers 8
mass 25
reserve -1
expand 1
counter 1
navtilt 0
cover 0
intercept 1
guard_cap 0
aa_cover 0
forward 0
scout 1
raid 0
rush 0
creep 0
hold 0
riposte 0
kite 0
tech 0
lurk 0
allin 0
strike 0
medics 0
navy 0
battery 0
decoys 0
hp_floor 0
bunkers 0
flame 0
close 0
income_ladder 0
guns 0
nukes 0
rebuild 0
brace 0
